    "created_at": "2015-11-11T17:07:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-11T17:07:00Z",
    "body": "The way to not consider new stuff was to iterate once and only store pointers for the stuff currently in the list. So you wouldn't have any pointers to newly added listeners.\n",
